INSERT INTO sources VALUES('SRC-3D94FB',1,'[Partner] _ HubSpot Flexible Seats-and-Credits Pricing & Packaging _ Slide Library.pdf','pdf','intern','[Partner] _ HubSpot Flexible Seats-and-Credits Pricing & Packaging _ Slide Library.pdf','pdf-20260915','2026-09-15 06:32:35','2026-09-15 06:32:35',NULL,0,'weekly',NULL,NULL,NULL,unistr('Flexible pricing for \u000athe way you work \u000aAI is reshaping how work gets done and empowering \u000ateams to do more. But putting AI to work alongside your \u000ateam shouldn’t mean managing budgets across a dozen \u000atools or paying for something that isn’t driving results.\u000a\u000aWith HubSpot, pricing doesn’t get in your way. Pay for \u000awhat you need and scale when you’re ready. No large \u000abase fees. No piecing together separate products. You’re \u000ain control of your spend every step of the way.\u000a\u000aHubSpot\u000aHubSpot is an agentic customer platform \u000athat gives humans and agents what they \u000aneed to drive real outcomes.\u000aPurchase HubSpot’s platform at the \u000aedition that supports your business size \u000aand maturity. Editions include Starter, \u000aProfessional, or Enterprise. \u000aSee current pricing.\u000a\u000a\u000a \u000aFeatures\u000a\u000aHere’s how it works.\u000aChoose the edition that \u000asupports your goals. \u000a\u000aGive teams access \u000ato data and features \u000ain HubSpot.\u000aPre-load capacity \u000afor the features you \u000arely on.\u000a1. Choose Edition\u00092. Add Seats\u00093. Add Packs  \u000aPower AI agents \u000aand features that do \u000awork for you.\u000a3. Add Credits\u000a\u000aStarter\u0009Professional\u0009Enterprise\u000aEditions\u000aPurchase HubSpot''s platform at the edition that \u000asupports your business size and maturity. \u000aFOR GROWING TEAMS \u0009FOR MATURE TEAMS\u0009FOR SOPHISTICATED TEAMS \u000aEssential tools for \u000agrowing teams. \u000aComprehensive tools for \u000amature businesses.\u000aAdvanced tools for \u000asophisticated businesses.\u000a5,000 credits included\u000aUp to 10 paid users\u000a\u000a   Run AI-powered outreach to prospects\u000a   Enrich your contacts and companies\u000a   Capture leads with online forms\u000a   Send targeted email campaigns\u000a   Receive and make calls from HubSpot\u000a   Chat with visitors on your website\u000a10,000 credits included\u000a\u000a\u000a   Resolve customer issues with AI\u000a   Get found in AI search engines\u000a   Use AI to keep deals moving forward\u000a   Manage your support channels \u000a   Automate work across your business\u000a   Project future revenue for your team\u000a\u000a15,000 credits included\u000a\u000a\u000a   Organize users across multiple levels\u000a   Control the data users can view and edit\u000a   Manage multiple websites in one place\u000a   Test changes with a sandbox account\u000a   Get content approved before publishing\u000a   Connect multiple HubSpot accounts\u000a\u000aSeats\u000aHubSpot offers two primary seat types; \u000aGTM Seats and Ops Seats. Each seat \u000atype is designed to give users tailored \u000aaccess to the features and data they \u000aneed to do their job.\u000a\u000a\u000a\u000a\u000a\u000aSee current seat pricing.\u000a\u000aGTM Seats include Ops Seat access. \u000aSee all features on Product & Services Catalog.\u000a\u000aSeats\u000aConnect teams to HubSpot’s agentic customer platform with HubSpot Seats. \u000aChoose between GTM Seats, Ops Seats, and View-only Seats. \u000a\u000a\u000aConnect with customers\u000a\u000aBuild demand, win deals, delight customers\u000aBuild the foundation\u000a\u000aSet guardrails, automate work, track progress\u000a\u000a\u000aGTM Seat\u0009Ops Seat\u000aView-only Seats—give visibility to users who don’t need to edit\u000a\u000aGTM Seat\u000aFor users that need to connect with customers \u000adirectly or at scale. Access the entire agentic \u000acustomer platform, including Breeze Assistant \u000aand Smart CRM. Best for marketing, sales, and \u000aservice. \u000a\u000a\u000a\u000a\u000aWork smarter with AI that knows your business\u000a\u000a● Create content that matches your company’s voice and style\u000a● Use plain language to build agents and workﬂows\u000a● Ask questions and get instant answers based on your customer data\u000a\u000aWin more deals and get paid faster\u000a\u000a● Identify high-intent buyers with signals and grow your pipeline\u000a● Keep deals moving with AI that turns every meeting into next steps\u000a● Build quotes, invoice customers, and collect revenue faster\u000a\u000aReach the right buyers and turn them into leads\u000a\u000a● Use AI to build content and run campaigns across your channels\u000a● Get discovered where buyers search with HubSpot AEO\u000a● Nurture leads at scale with AI-powered email automation\u000a\u000aGTM Seats include Ops Seat access. \u000aSee all features on Product & Services Catalog\u000a\u000aKeep customers happy and coming back\u000a\u000a● Resolve customer questions faster, without the manual work\u000a● Give customers resources to ﬁnd answers on their own\u000a● Stay ahead of risk with AI that tracks customer health and takes action\u000a\u000aOps Seat\u000aFor users that support customer-facing teams. \u000aBuild what your teams need with automation, \u000agovernance, and reporting tools. Best for \u000aoperations professionals.\u000a\u000a\u000aAutomate the work that doesn’t need a human\u000a\u000a● Build automations tailored to the way your business works\u000a● See which workﬂows are healthy and which need your attention\u000a● Create segments that stay up-to-date automatically\u000a\u000a\u000aBuild the structure your teams need to operate\u000a\u000a● Control what each person on your team can do in HubSpot\u000a● Set up your CRM to reﬂect how your business works\u000a● Connect HubSpot to the tools your team already uses\u000a\u000a\u000aSee all features on Product & Services Catalog\u000a \u000aSee what’s working across your teams\u000a\u000a● Bring all your data together in one place for faster insights\u000a● Act on insights with reports built on complete customer context\u000a● Give every team their own view of what matters\u000a\u000aAdditional seats can be \u000apurchased at any time.\u000aHubSpot Seat Types \u000a▸Product & Services Catalog\u000a\u000aCurrent Seat Pricing\u000a▸Pricing Page\u000a\u000aManaging Seats\u000a▸Knowledge Base \u000aManage your seats in \u000aSettings ➞ Users & Teams ➞ Seats\u000a\u000aCapacity Packs\u000aHubSpot offers packs that let you \u000apre-load capacity for the features \u000aand AI agents your team relies on. \u000aWhen you need more, additional credits \u000apick up where the pack leaves off. \u000a\u000a\u000a\u000a\u000a\u000aSee current capacity pack pricing.\u000a\u000aPricing: Email Sends\u000a\u000aAdd email sending capacity to your subscription for a monthly fee:\u000a\u000a\u000a\u000a\u000a\u000a\u000a\u000a\u000a\u000aEmail sends used within your monthly capacity do not use credits. \u000a\u000aAdditional email sends* used beyond your monthly capacity are paid \u000afor with HubSpot Credits. Your email send capacity resets monthly.  \u000a*All emails sent in HubSpot, except for one-to-one emails sent from a connected or hosted inbox, will use HubSpot Credits.\u000aSee current email send capacity pack pricing\u000a \u000a2,000 \u000a\u000aemail sends\u000aper month \u000a10,000 \u000a\u000aemail sends\u000a per month \u000a100,000 \u000a\u000aemail sends \u000aper month \u000a1,000,000 \u000a\u000aemail sends\u000aper month\u000a\u000aWhich email types count \u000atowards my email capacity?\u000aAny email sent by HubSpot uses credits. This \u000aincludes marketing, transactional, and automated \u000aemails (e.g., meeting reminders, surveys). \u000a\u000aAny email sent by your team does not use credits. \u000aThis includes any email sent from a connected inbox \u000a(e.g., emails sent from CRM records, sequences, \u000aconversations inbox). \u000a\u000aYou can purchase email sending capacity up-front \u000ato more easily plan your spend. \u000aLearn more about how emails use credits.\u000a\u000aCompany: Acme Inc. \u000aTotal contacts: 20,000\u000aAverage sends per month: 40,000\u000aEmail sending pack: Medium (10,000 sends per month)\u000aCredits purchased up-front: 150,000 (30,000 additional sends per month)\u000aPricing Email Sends\u000aJan\u000aPurchased email sending capacity\u000aEmail sends included with capacity\u000a45,000*\u000aMonthly emails sent\u000a10,000\u000aEmail sends paid for with additional credits\u000aDec\u000a*Set a feature-level credit limit for email sends to control the total number of credits the email feature can use in a month.\u000aThe above image is illustrative. Actual usage will vary.\u000aFeb Mar Apr May Jun Jul Aug Sep Oct Nov\u000aPurchased credit capacity\u000a40,000\u000a\u000aPricing: Workﬂow Actions  \u000a\u000aAdd workﬂow capacity to your subscription for a monthly fee:\u000a\u000a\u000a\u000a\u000a\u000a\u000a\u000a\u000a\u000aWorkﬂow actions used within your monthly capacity do not use credits. \u000a\u000aAdditional workﬂow actions used beyond your monthly capacity are paid \u000afor with HubSpot Credits. Your workﬂow action capacity resets monthly.       \u000aLearn more about how workﬂows use HubSpot Credits\u000aSee current workﬂow capacity pack pricing \u000aGrowth Pack\u000a\u000a500,000 \u000a\u000aworkﬂow actions per month \u000aScaled Pack\u000a\u000a500,000,000 \u000a\u000aworkﬂow actions per month\u000a\u000aGrowth Workﬂow Actions Capacity Pack\u000aBuilt for growing businesses, for one ﬂat monthly fee.\u000a\u000aWith 500,000 actions per month, you can run 10 automated actions for \u000a50,000 contacts, every month. \u000aBest for businesses with\u000a\u000a\u000a●Growing database. \u000a● \u000a● Enough contacts that manual outreach doesn''t scale.\u000a\u000a●Standard compliance needs. \u000a● \u000a● Fewer regulatory requirements means less automated checks.\u000a\u000a●Straightforward business processes.\u000a● \u000a● Following common playbooks that take less actions to run.\u000a\u000aBest for businesses with:\u000a\u000aScaled Workﬂow Actions Capacity Pack\u000aAutomate at enterprise scale, for one ﬂat monthly fee.\u000a\u000aWith 500,000,000 actions per month, you can run 500 automated \u000aactions for 1 million contacts, every month. \u000aBest for businesses with\u000a\u000a\u000a●Large database size. \u000a● \u000a● Every contact needs its own automated journey.\u000a\u000a●Multiple teams. \u000a● \u000a● More teams mean more workﬂows running in parallel. \u000a\u000a●Robust governance needs. \u000a● \u000a● Staying compliant means automation that enforces rules.\u000a\u000a●Sophisticated business processes.\u000a● \u000a● More tailored automation takes more actions to run it.\u000a\u000aBest for businesses with:\u000a\u000aBase Agents Pack\u000a\u000a\u000aThe Base Agents Pack is built for small teams that need a simple way to \u000amove faster. For €25/mo, put AI agents to work that actually know your \u000abusiness, your pipeline, your customers, and how you work.\u000a\u000a● Find and reach the right leads with prospecting agent.\u000a● Research accounts and track buying signals with data agent.\u000a● Get paid faster with revenue agent.\u000a● Build agents and simpliﬁed automation tailored to the way you \u000awork with agent builder.\u000a\u000aDon''t need something on that list? Use the €25 to put the agents that \u000amatter most to work and pause the others. When you''re ready to give \u000aagents more work, you can add more capacity at any time with HubSpot \u000aCredits.\u000a\u000a\u000aLearn more about HubSpot’s AI agents. \u000aBest for growing teams\u000a\u000aGrowth Agents Pack\u0009Marketing\u000a\u000a\u000aThe Growth Agents Pack is built for focused teams that are ready to do \u000amore. For €400/mo, put AI agents to work that actually know your ICP, \u000acontent gaps, brand voice, and what’s converting.\u000a\u000a● Turn recommendations into assets with content agent.\u000a● Personalize marketing emails at scale with nurture agent.\u000a● Build agents and automation tailored to the way you work with \u000aagent builder.\u000a\u000aDon''t need something on that list? Use the €400 to put the agents that \u000amatter most to work and pause the others. When you''re ready to give \u000aagents more work, you can add more capacity at any time with HubSpot \u000aCredits.\u000a\u000a\u000aLearn more about HubSpot’s AI agents. \u000a\u000aBest for mature marketing teams\u000a\u000aGrowth Agents Pack\u0009Sales\u000a\u000a\u000aThe Growth Agents Pack is built for focused teams that are ready to do \u000amore. For €400/mo, put AI agents to work that actually know your \u000abusiness, buying signals, conversation history, and what plays win \u000adeals.\u000a\u000a● Find and reach the right leads with prospecting agent.\u000a● Research accounts and track buying signals with data agent.\u000a● Get paid faster with revenue agent.\u000a● Build agents and automation tailored to the way you work with \u000aagent builder.\u000a\u000aDon''t need something on that list? Use the €400 to put the agents that \u000amatter most to work and pause the others. When you''re ready to give \u000aagents more work, you can add more capacity at any time with \u000aHubSpot Credits.\u000a\u000a\u000aLearn more about HubSpot’s AI agents. \u000aBest for mature sales teams\u000a\u000aGrowth Agents Pack\u0009Service\u000a\u000a\u000aThe Growth Agents Pack is built for focused teams that are ready to do \u000amore. For €400/mo, put AI agents to work that actually know your \u000acustomers, your business, and your processes.\u000a\u000a● Give your customers help anytime with customer agent.\u000a● Know your customers before responding with data agent.\u000a● Create help articles faster with knowledge base agent.\u000a● Build agents and automation tailored to the way you work with \u000aagent builder.\u000a\u000aDon''t need something on that list? Use the €400 to put the agents that \u000amatter most to work and pause the others. When you''re ready to give \u000aagents more work, you can add more capacity at any time with \u000aHubSpot Credits.\u000a\u000a\u000aLearn more about HubSpot’s AI agents. \u000a\u000aBest for mature service teams\u000a\u000aScaled Agents Pack\u0009Marketing\u000a\u000a\u000aThe Scaled Agents Pack is built for businesses operating at scale. For \u000a€1,500/mo, deploy AI agents that actually know your ICP, content gaps, \u000abrand voice, and what’s converting across every segment.\u000a\u000a● Turn recommendations into assets with content agent.\u000a● Personalize marketing emails at scale with nurture agent.\u000a● Build agents and automation tailored to the way you work with \u000aagent builder.\u000a\u000aDon''t need something on that list? Use the €1,500 to put the agents that \u000amatter most to work and pause the others. When you''re ready to give \u000aagents more work, you can add more capacity at any time with HubSpot \u000aCredits.\u000a\u000a\u000aLearn more about HubSpot’s AI agents. \u000a\u000aBest for sophisticated marketing teams\u000a\u000aScaled Agents Pack\u0009Sales\u000a\u000a\u000aThe Scaled Agents Pack is built for businesses operating at scale.. For \u000a€1,500/mo, deploy AI agents that actually know your business, buying \u000asignals, conversation history, and what your top reps do differently.\u000a\u000a● Find and reach the right leads with prospecting agent.\u000a● Research accounts and track buying signals with data agent.\u000a● Collect revenue faster with revenue agent.\u000a● Build agents and automation tailored to the way you work with \u000aagent builder.\u000a\u000aDon''t need something on that list? Use the €1,500 to put the agents \u000athat matter most to work and pause the others. When you''re ready to \u000agive agents more work, you can add more capacity at any time with \u000aHubSpot Credits.\u000a\u000a\u000aLearn more about HubSpot’s AI agents. \u000a \u000aBest for sophisticated sales teams\u000a\u000aScaled Agents Pack\u0009Service\u000a\u000a\u000aThe Scaled Agents Pack is built for businesses operating at scale.. \u000aFor €1,500/mo, deploy AI agents that actually know your customers, \u000ayour business, your processes, and your systems.\u000a\u000a● Give your customers help anytime with customer agent.\u000a● Know your customers before responding with data agent.\u000a● Create help articles faster with knowledge base agent.\u000a● Build agents and automation tailored to the way you work \u000awith agent builder.\u000a\u000aDon''t need something on that list? Use the €1,500 to put the agents \u000athat matter most to work and pause the others. When you''re ready to \u000agive agents more work, you can add more capacity at any time with \u000aHubSpot Credits.\u000a\u000a\u000aLearn more about HubSpot’s AI agents. \u000a \u000aBest for sophisticated service teams\u000a\u000aScenario: Acme Inc. purchased the Professional Agent Pack, which gives them 40,000 \u000acredits at a ﬂat monthly rate. They want to give their teams additional budget to \u000aexplore additional use cases for AI across their operations. \u000a\u000aIncluded with plan: 10,000 credits\u000aAgents Pack: 40,000 credits (€400/mo)\u000aPortal-level credit limit: 60,000\u000aHubSpot Credits Spend Controls\u000aJan\u000aIncluded credits\u000aPortal-level credit limit\u000aCovered by plan, not billed\u000a60,000\u000aCredits used\u000a10,000\u000aAdditional credits, billed with PAYG\u000aDec\u000aThe above image is illustrative. Actual usage will vary.\u000aUse feature-level credit limits to control how many credits individual features and AI agents use.\u000a\u000aFeb Mar Apr May Jun Jul Aug Sep Oct Nov\u000aCommitted credits via agent pack\u000aAcme Inc. will never use \u000amore than 60,000 credits \u000a(€600) in a month.\u000a50,000\u000a\u000aHubSpot Credits\u000aHubSpot has powerful AI agents and \u000afeatures that do work for you. You can \u000atake advantage of these features with \u000aHubSpot Credits—a simple, ﬂexible way \u000ato pay for what you use.\u000a\u000aLearn more about HubSpot Credits.\u000a\u000aYour subscription already includes credits \u000ato get started.\u000aSTARTER\u000a\u000a5,000\u000a\u000acredits/month\u000aPROFESSIONAL\u000a\u000a10,000\u000a\u000acredits/month\u000aENTERPRISE\u000a\u000a15,000\u000a\u000acredits/month\u000aYou can purchase additional credits in 1,000 (€10) credit packs, as needed.\u000a\u000aHubSpot gives you control \u000ato manage credits your way.\u000a\u000a\u000a▸Scale your business on your own terms with \u000aHubSpot Credits. \u000a\u000a▸Buy credits up-front for predictable costs or \u000aPay-as-You-Go to only pay for what you use.\u000a\u000a▸Set granular spending caps to protect your \u000abudget, and pause features when priorities shift.\u000a\u000a▸Get a clear view of every action taken: which \u000aagents ran, which features ﬁred, and what each \u000aone produced.\u000aTo learn more about HubSpot Credits, visit the Product & Services catalog\u000a\u000aHubSpot Credits Demo\u000a\u000aYou pay when content agent generates content (blog posts, \u000alanding pages, or social posts) for you for you from AEO \u000arecommendations, campaign agent, and the social tool.\u000a\u000a\u000a\u000a\u000a\u000a\u000a\u000a\u000a\u000a\u000a\u000a\u000a\u000a\u000a\u000a\u000a\u000a\u000a\u000a\u000aContent agent is included in Professional and Enterprise subscriptions and runs on HubSpot Credits. \u000a\u000a\u000a€10 per piece of contentPricing: Content agent [Beta]  \u000aYou see a recommendation in HubSpot AEO to publish a blog \u000apost about your loyalty program, and choose to have content \u000aagent draft the post.\u000a\u000aYou pay content agent €10 when it drafts the blog post. \u000aExample\u000a\u000aYou pay when nurture agent personalizes an email \u000afor a contact.\u000a\u000a\u000a\u000a\u000a\u000a\u000a\u000a\u000a\u000a\u000a\u000a\u000a\u000a\u000a\u000a\u000a\u000aNurture agent is included in Professional and Enterprise subscriptions and runs on HubSpot Credits.\u000a€0.10 per emailPricing: Nurture agent  [Beta]\u000a\u000a \u000a\u000aYou use nurture agent to personalize a welcome email \u000aautomatically at send time for 100 contacts so that they get a \u000amessage that is written speciﬁcally for them, using CRM data, \u000abusiness context, and activity data.\u000a\u000aYou pay nurture agent €0.10 per email personalized, or €10. \u000aExample\u000a\u000aYou pay when revenue agent starts payment collection \u000aoutreach for an invoice. \u000a\u000a\u000a\u000a\u000a\u000a\u000a\u000a\u000a\u000a\u000a\u000a\u000a\u000a\u000a\u000aCredits are not used when when the payment is collected.\u000a\u000a\u000a\u000aRevenue agent is included in all HubSpot subscriptions and runs on HubSpot Credits.\u000a€5 per invoice, when \u000aoutreach is started\u000aPricing: Revenue agent [Beta]  \u000aYou have 30 invoices with outstanding balances greater than \u000a€5,000. You use revenue agent to ensure payment on these \u000ainvoices happens.\u000a\u000aTo start outreach for 30 invoices, you pay revenue agent \u000a€150.  \u000aExample\u000a\u000a€0.50 per resolution\u000aYou pay when customer agent resolves a conversation without \u000ahelp from a human. \u000a\u000a\u000a\u000a\u000a\u000a\u000a\u000a\u000a\u000a\u000a\u000a\u000a\u000aRead the most up to date deﬁnition of a resolution\u000a\u000a\u000aCustomer agent is included in all Professional and Enterprise subscriptions and runs on HubSpot Credits.\u000aPricing: Customer agent [messaging] \u000a\u000aA customer asks customer agent for a password reset. \u000aCustomer agent performs the reset action automatically. The \u000acustomer isn''t transferred to a rep and doesn’t re-open the \u000aconversation within 72 hours.\u000a\u000aYou pay customer agent €0.50 when it resolves the \u000aconversation.  \u000aExample\u000a\u000a€0.50 per minute\u000aYou pay when customer agent holds a minute of voice conversation.\u000a\u000a\u000a\u000a\u000a\u000a\u000a\u000a\u000a\u000a\u000a\u000a\u000a\u000a\u000a\u000a\u000a\u000aCustomer agent is included in all Professional and Enterprise subscriptions and runs on HubSpot Credits.\u000aPricing: Customer agent [voice] [Beta] \u000a\u000aA customer calls your business and connects with customer \u000aagent. Customer agent engages with the customer, asking \u000aquestions and providing answers where needed. Four minutes \u000alater, the call ends.\u000a\u000aYou pay customer agent €2 when the call ends.  \u000aExample\u000a\u000a€1 per lead\u000aYou pay when prospecting agent recommends outreach for a lead. \u000a\u000aLeads can be enrolled in prospecting agent either manually or automatically.\u000a\u000a\u000a\u000a\u000a\u000a\u000a\u000a\u000a\u000a\u000a\u000a\u000a\u000a\u000a\u000aProspecting agent is included in all Starter, Professional, and Enterprise subscriptions and runs on HubSpot Credits.\u000aPricing: Prospecting agent [Beta]  \u000aYou set up a rule to automatically enroll any contact who ﬁlls out a \u000ademo request form. Over the course of a month, 200 contacts submit \u000athe form and get enrolled in prospecting agent.\u000a\u000aYou pay prospecting agent €200 to draft outreach for 200 leads.  \u000aExample\u000a\u000a€0.10 per answer\u000a\u000aYou pay when data agent updates your CRM.\u000a\u000a\u000a\u000a\u000a\u000a\u000a\u000a\u000a\u000a\u000a\u000a\u000a\u000a\u000a\u000a\u000aData agent is included in all Starter, Professional, and Enterprise subscriptions and runs on HubSpot Credits.\u000a\u000aBaseline enrichment (e.g., job title, annual revenue) of contacts and companies is included with all paid HubSpot plans. Learn \u000amore about baseline enrichment\u000a\u000a\u000aPricing: Data agent [Smart Properties]   \u000aYou create a smart property called "customer health summary" that \u000aanalyzes recent account activity. You schedule data agent to update \u000athe property monthly across 200 active accounts.\u000a\u000aYou pay data agent €20/mo to update the property for 200 \u000arecords monthly.  \u000aExample\u000a\u000aYou pay when data agent creates and/or monitors \u000aone company.\u000a\u000a\u000a\u000a\u000a\u000a\u000a\u000a\u000a\u000a\u000a\u000a\u000a\u000a\u000a\u000aData agent is included in all Starter, Professional, and Enterprise subscriptions and runs on HubSpot Credits.\u000aBuyer intent: €0.10 per company/mo\u000aCustom signals: €0.50 per company/mo\u000aMarket segments [Beta]: €0.10 per company\u000aPricing: Intent [Powered by data agent]\u000a\u000a \u000aYou start tracking 50 target accounts so HubSpot can monitor for \u000asignals (like funding rounds, executive hires, and job changes) and \u000aalert you when it''s the right time to reach out.\u000a\u000aYou pay data agent €5/mo to monitor 50 companies.  \u000aExample\u000a\u000aYou pay when knowledge base agent generates one new \u000aknowledge base article.\u000a\u000a\u000a\u000a\u000a\u000a\u000a\u000a\u000a\u000a\u000a\u000a\u000a\u000a\u000a\u000a\u000aKnowledge base agent is included in Professional and Enterprise subscriptions and runs on HubSpot Credits.\u000aPricing: Knowledge base agent [Beta]\u000a\u000a\u000a€2 per article \u000aAfter analyzing your tickets and conversation, knowledge base agent \u000aidentiﬁed 5 recurring support topics currently not covered in your \u000aknowledge base.\u000a\u000aYou pay knowledge base agent €10 to create 5 new knowledge \u000abase articles. \u000aExample\u000a\u000aYou pay when you run a custom agent. \u000a\u000aCustom agents run prompts on your behalf, which are measured in “action units”. \u000aThe total number of action units required for your prompts will determine the \u000anumber of credits consumed.\u000a\u000aHere’s how it works:\u000a\u000a\u000a\u000a\u000a\u000a\u000a\u000a\u000a\u000a\u000a\u000a\u000a\u000aCustom agents are included in Professional and Enterprise subscriptions and run on HubSpot Credits.\u000aAction unit values shown are illustrative. Actual values will vary every time the agent is run.  \u000aPricing: Custom agents [Beta]\u000aWhen a demo is booked, build a personalized script for the \u000acompany, save to company record, and notify rep. \u000aCustom prompt\u000aSummarize record\u000aCreate note\u000aCreate task\u000aAction\u000aAction\u000aAction\u000a43 \u000aaction units\u000a7 \u000aaction units\u000a22\u000aaction units\u000a72 credits (€0.72)\u000a72\u000aaction units\u000aCost for this run\u000a\u000aCredits Features by Hub & Tier.\u000aFeature\u0009Action\u0009Credits Tier\u000aAI Agents\u000aCustomer Agent Resolve one conversation (text-based channels)\u000950 Pro, Enterprise\u000aCustomer Agent (Beta) Hold one minute of voice conversation\u000950 Pro, Enterprise\u000aProspecting Agent Recommend outreach for one lead\u0009100 Starter. Pro, Enterprise\u000aData Agent\u0009Generate a response to one prompt for one record \u000910 Starter, Pro, Enterprise \u000aIntent \u000aPowered by data agent\u000aGenerate and/or monitor one company with HubSpot intent signals for one month 10 Starter, Pro, Enterprise \u000aIntent (Beta)\u000aPowered by data agent\u000aMonitor one company for one custom signal for one month \u000950 Starter, Pro, Enterprise \u000aIntent (Beta)\u000aPowered by data agent\u000aCreate one company record from market segments \u000910 Starter, Pro, Enterprise \u000aView HubSpot’s rate sheet for more information.\u000a\u000aCredits Features by Hub & Tier.\u000aFeature\u0009Action\u0009Credits Tier\u000aAI Agents\u000aContent Agent (Beta)\u0009Generate one piece of content\u00091,000 Pro, Enterprise\u000aRevenue Agent (Beta)\u0009Start payment collection outreach for one invoice\u0009500 Starter, Pro, Enterprise\u000aNurture Agent (Beta)\u0009Personalize one email for a contact\u000910 Pro, Enterprise\u000aKnowledge Base Agent (Beta) Generate one new knowledge base article\u0009200 Pro, Enterprise\u000aCustom agents (Beta)\u0009Use one action unit*\u00091 Pro, Enterprise\u000aView HubSpot’s rate sheet for more information.\u000a*Custom agents run prompts on your behalf, which is measured in “action units.” The total number of action units required for your prompts \u000awill determine the number of credits consumed. You can review the estimated credits when you test the custom agent during setup.\u000a\u000aCredits Features by Hub & Tier.\u000aFeature\u0009Action\u0009Credits Tier\u000aMessaging\u0009\u0009 \u000aEmail*\u000aSend one email through HubSpot (excluding 1:1 emails) (1-10,000 sends)\u000915 Starter, Pro, Enterprise\u000aSend one email through HubSpot (excluding 1:1 emails) (10,001-55,000 sends) 5 Starter, Pro, Enterprise\u000aSend one email through HubSpot (excluding 1:1 emails) (55,001-100,000 sends) 2 Starter, Pro, Enterprise\u000aSend one email through HubSpot (excluding 1:1 emails) (100,001+ sends)\u0009.5 Starter, Pro, Enterprise\u000aCalling\u0009Add one calling minute to your HubSpot portal\u000910 Starter, Pro, Enterprise\u000aWhatsApp\u0009Send one templated WhatsApp message through HubSpot \u000920 Pro, Enterprise\u000aView HubSpot’s rate sheet for more information.\u000a*All emails sent in HubSpot, except for one-to-one emails sent from a connected or hosted inbox, will use HubSpot Credits.\u000a\u000aCredits Features by Hub & Tier.\u000aFeature\u0009Action\u0009Credits Tier\u000aAutomation & Data\u000aWorkﬂows*\u000aExecute one workﬂow action (1-10,000 actions)\u00093 Pro, Enterprise\u000aExecute one workﬂow action (10,001-55,000 actions)\u00092 Pro, Enterprise\u000aExecute one workﬂow action (55,001-100,000 actions)\u0009.5 Pro, Enterprise\u000aExecute one workﬂow action (100,001+ actions)\u0009.1 Pro, Enterprise\u000aExecute one Breeze workﬂow action\u000910 Pro, Enterprise\u000aData Studio Syncs** \u000a(Beta)\u000aRun sync based on a small data source (<500K rows) per destination \u000950 Pro, Enterprise \u000aRun sync based on a medium data source (500K - 5 million rows) per destination  100 Pro, Enterprise \u000aRun sync based on a large data source (>5 million rows) per destination \u0009200 Pro, Enterprise \u000aView HubSpot’s rate sheet for more information.\u000a*Learn more about how workﬂows use HubSpot Credits\u000a**Each use of a dataset in a workﬂow, segment, CRM sync, or export. Using a dataset in a report does not consume credits.\u000a\u000aCredits Features by Hub & Tier.\u000aFeature\u0009Action\u0009Credits Tier\u000aCommerce\u000aQuotes\u0009Capture one accepted quote in HubSpot\u0009100 Pro, Enterprise\u000aCustom Events\u0009\u0009 \u000aCustom events\u00091,000 additional events (over capacity)\u000915 Pro, Enterprise\u000aAEO (Beta)\u0009\u0009 \u000aAEO\u0009Get one answer to a tracked prompt.\u00092 Pro, Enterprise\u000aConversational context \u0009 \u000aConversational context Get analysis for one conversational record.\u00091 Starter, Pro, Enterprise\u000aView HubSpot’s rate sheet for more information.\u000a\u000aNow that you know what''s \u000aincluded, here''s how to \u000aaccess your credits.\u000aCredits Usage Details \u000a▸Product & Services Catalog\u000a\u000aBilling & Management\u000a▸Knowledge Base \u000a\u000a\u000aCheck your included credits in \u000aAccount ➞ Usage & Limits ➞ HubSpot Credits\u000a\u000aWhich object types count \u000atowards my record limit?\u000aYour HubSpot plan includes limit for the number of \u000aCRM records you can store. All applicable object \u000atypes available with your plan counts towards this \u000alimit. \u000a\u000aYou can view the object types available with your \u000aplan and monitor their usage in your portal. \u000a\u000aAdd more records at any time to increase your \u000acapacity. \u000aLearn more about managing object limits\u000aObject types shown above are illustrative. Actual object types will vary based on your subscription.'),NULL);
INSERT INTO sources VALUES('SRC-C4D86A',1,'en.txt','pdf','intern','en.txt','pdf-20260915','2026-09-15 06:41:00','2026-09-15 06:41:00',NULL,0,'weekly',NULL,NULL,NULL,'HubSpot flexible seats pricing. Companies waste budget on unused licenses. Automation must be built cleanly from the start. Many teams buy tools before defining their sales process. Forecast accuracy improves with data hygiene.',NULL);
INSERT INTO sources VALUES('SRC-D41A73',1,unistr('Aggregierte Angle-Übersicht — bereinigt, dedupliziert\u000a\u000aBatch: HubSpot April 2026...'),'research','intern',NULL,'quick-20260915','2026-09-15 09:22:53','2026-09-15 09:22:53',NULL,0,'weekly',NULL,NULL,NULL,unistr('Aggregierte Angle-Übersicht — bereinigt, dedupliziert\u000a\u000aBatch: HubSpot April 2026 (5)\u000a\u000aCall-Auto-Sync ins CRM — manuelle Pflege entfällt\u000aKI extrahiert Budget/Timing-Signale aus Calls & Mails\u000aMarkensichtbarkeit in ChatGPT/Perplexity — die meisten KMU bei null\u000aDuplikate-Score — Kundenvertrauen statt nur Speicherplatz\u000aKI-Feature-Release-Tempo April > letzte 6 Monate\u000a\u000aBatch: Agent Era (5)\u000a\u000aDatenqualität ist Umsatzthema, nicht IT-Thema\u000aBezahlung für erledigte Arbeit statt Software\u000aPartner bauen branchenspezifische Agenten — Prozesswissen zählt\u000aDeal-Risiko-Scores aus 280.000 Kunden — Eigenbau-CRM hält nicht mit\u000aZögerlichkeit als Wettbewerbsnachteil\u000a\u000aBatch: Cixon-Wettbewerb (5 aktiv, 1 verwendet — Duplikat zu Agent Era Punkt 1)\u000a\u000aPartner zeigen Tool-Funktion, nicht was danach passiert\u000aCRM bremst durch fehlende Kostendefinition pro Vertriebsschritt\u000a200+ Partner in DE — Differenzierung über System statt Tool\u000aAgent auf schlechten Daten (Dublette, bereits „verwendet")\u000a7 Jahre / 100 Projekte — Zeit für Evaluierung als Learning\u000a\u000aBatch: Sonstige (1)\u000a\u000aNeuer Vertriebler performt nicht → fehlendes System, nicht fehlender Mensch\u000a\u000aBatch: Pricing/Neues Modell (7, aus D-1 bis D-7)\u000a\u000aKein Seat-Minimum — Einstieg auch für kleine Teams\u000aGTM Seat vereint alle Rollen — kein Lizenz-Jonglieren\u000aStarter→Pro→Enterprise ohne Neuaufbau\u000aCredits = nutzungsbasiert, fair für kleine Teams\u000aEin System statt Hub-Silos\u000aOps Seat 9€/Monat — Einstiegshürde gefallen\u000a3 Kaufentscheidungen statt 70+ — Partner-Wert verschiebt sich zu System-Aufbau\u000a\u000aNeu identifiziert, nicht dupliziert (aus Partner-PDF, thematisch neu)\u000a\u000aTCO über 3 Jahre als CFO-Argument (Rechenbeispiel-Format)\u000aCross-Selling durch Plattform-Verweildauer statt neuem Pitch\u000aFull-Platform-Onboarding ersetzt Hub-by-Hub-Projekte\u000aCapacity Packs als Budget-Fixbetrag statt Overrun-Risiko\u000a\u000aDuplikat-Check gesamt:\u000a\u000a„Agent auf schlechten Daten" — 2x (Agent Era #1, Cixon #4) → Cixon-Version bleibt "verwendet", Agent-Era-Version streichen oder differenzieren\u000a„Ops Seat 9€" (Pricing #6) ≈ neues TCO-Angle — Bezug herstellen, keine Dublette'),NULL);
